msgctxt "18216_Tanimura"
msgid "There's no need to get carried away."
msgstr "No hay porque dejarse llevar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18228_Chihiro"
msgid "If I took Chachamaru out for a walk, you could get a chance to pet him."
msgstr "Si sacara a pasear a Chachamaru, podría tener la oportunidad de acariciarlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18240_Tanimura"
msgid "Huh. Rabbits aren't the same as dogs, are they?"
msgstr "¿Eh? Pero un conejo no es lo mismo que un perro, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18252_Chihiro"
msgid "Yeah. You might still get a chance to pet him someday."
msgstr "Sí. Quizá usted todavía tenga la oportunidad de acariciarlo un día de estos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18264_Tanimura"
msgid "What sort of actress do you want to be?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de actriz quieres ser?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18276_Tanimura"
msgid "You're both a college student and a hostess?"
msgstr "¿Eres estudiante y también hostess?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18288_Tanimura"
msgid "How much money are you trying to make?"
msgstr "¿Cuánto dinero estás tratando de conseguir?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18300_Tanimura"
msgid "Can you try a little bit for me?"
msgstr "¿Puedes actuar un poco para mí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18312_Tanimura"
msgid "That's an unusual hobby."
msgstr "Es un pasatiempo inusual."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18324_Tanimura"
msgid "Why didn't you join the normal theater club?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no te uniste a un club de teatro normal?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18336_Tanimura"
msgid "A pure and innocent woman."
msgstr "Una mujer pura e inocente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18348_Tanimura"
msgid "A strong-willed woman."
msgstr "Una mujer de carácter fuerte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18360_Tanimura"
msgid "A ditzy woman."
msgstr "Una mujer atolondrada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18372_Tanimura"
msgid "All I thought about was girls."
msgstr "En lo único que pensaba era en las chicas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18384_Tanimura"
msgid "I wasn't interested in love yet."
msgstr "No estaba interesado en el amor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18396_Tanimura"
msgid "All I thought about was horses."
msgstr "Lo único en que pensaba era en caballos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18408_Tanimura"
msgid "Want to touch me?"
msgstr "¿Quieres tocar?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18420_Tanimura"
msgid "It's nothing, really."
msgstr "No es para tanto la verdad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18432_Tanimura"
msgid "It's even more impressive when I'm naked."
msgstr "Es incluso más impresionante cuando estoy desnudo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18444_Tanimura"
msgid "It can't be helped."
msgstr "No se puede evitar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18456_Tanimura"
msgid "It's cute."
msgstr "Es tierno."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18468_Tanimura"
msgid "You should train yourself to drink."
msgstr "Deberías entrenar para beber más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18480_Tanimura"
msgid "I don't think I'd get along with one."
msgstr "No creo que pueda llevarme bien con una."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18492_Tanimura"
msgid "I like anime too."
msgstr "A mí también me gusta el anime."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18504_Tanimura"
msgid "Why aren't you an otaku?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no te haría eso una otaku?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18516_Tanimura"
msgid "A girl should have a good appetite."
msgstr "Una chica debe tener buen apetito."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18528_Tanimura"
msgid "It's fine as long as you don't get fat."
msgstr "Mientras no engordes no pasa nada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18540_Tanimura"
msgid "Your health is what's important."
msgstr "Lo importante es tu salud."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18552_Tanimura"
msgid "Maybe he's lonely."
msgstr "Tal vez se sienta solo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18564_Tanimura"
msgid "Maybe he wants to go outside."
msgstr "Tal vez quiera salir afuera."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18576_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm sure he'll get better eventually."
msgstr "Seguro que pronto se pone mejor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18588_Tanimura"
msgid "That takes coordination."
msgstr "Eso requiere coordinación."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18600_Tanimura"
msgid "That's your special talent?"
msgstr "¿Ese es tu talento especial?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18612_Tanimura"
msgid "I'd give it a four out of ten."
msgstr "Mmm, te doy un cuatro sobre diez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18624_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, at least it was a good experience."
msgstr "Bueno, al menos fue una buena experiencia."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18636_Tanimura"
msgid "Is that all? That's nothing to get upset about."
msgstr "¿Solo eso? Eso no es nada como para desanimarse."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18648_Tanimura"
msgid "You need to think bigger!"
msgstr "¡Necesitas pensar en grande!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18660_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm just worried about you."
msgstr "Solo estoy preocupado por ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18672_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm sorry. Being a cop makes me suspicious."
msgstr "Lo siento. Ser policía me hace ser desconfiado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18684_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm telling you, he's taking advantage of you."
msgstr "Te lo aseguro, él se está aprovechando de ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18696_Tanimura"
msgid "Horse racing is good."
msgstr "Las carreras de caballos son un buen método."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18708_Tanimura"
msgid "There's nothing better than karaoke."
msgstr "No hay nada mejor que el karaoke."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18720_Tanimura"
msgid "How about a massage?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal un masaje?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18732_Tanimura"
msgid "Not all men are like that."
msgstr "No todos los hombres son así."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18744_Tanimura"
msgid "That's just the way men are."
msgstr "Así somos los hombres."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18756_Tanimura"
msgid "The woman bears some responsibility, too."
msgstr "La mujer también carga con algo de la responsabilidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18768_Tanimura"
msgid "You've been watching too many soap operas."
msgstr "Has estado viendo muchas telenovelas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18780_Tanimura"
msgid "You'll get your chance soon enough."
msgstr "Tendrás tu oportunidad pronto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18792_Tanimura"
msgid "You are still a child."
msgstr "Todavía eres una niña."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18804_Tanimura"
msgid "You were in the wrong."
msgstr "Estuviste mal."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18816_Tanimura"
msgid "That's pretty childish."
msgstr "Qué infantil."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18828_Tanimura"
msgid "I wish I had a brother or sister to fight with."
msgstr "Ojalá tuviera una hermana o un hermano con quien discutir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18840_Tanimura"
msgid "That's a relief."
msgstr "Qué alivio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18852_Tanimura"
msgid "You'll have to be more careful from now on."
msgstr "Tendrás que tener más cuidado ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18864_Tanimura"
msgid "You should read more about rabbits."
msgstr "Deberías leer más sobre los conejos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18876_Tanimura"
msgid "I like the railroad a lot."
msgstr "Sí, me gustan los ferrocarriles."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18888_Tanimura"
msgid "I've never really thought about it."
msgstr "Nunca pensé mucho en ello."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18900_Tanimura"
msgid "You're a rail buff but you like trains?"
msgstr "Eres fanática de la ferroviaria, ¿pero te gustan los trenes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18912_Tanimura"
msgid "Watch out for counterfeit brand names."
msgstr "Debes tener cuidado con las cosas de marca falsas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18924_Tanimura"
msgid "Be careful what you eat."
msgstr "Ten cuidado con lo que comes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18936_Tanimura"
msgid "Making mistakes is what makes traveling fun."
msgstr "Cometer errores hace que viajar sea divertido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18948_Tanimura"
msgid "You're taking it too seriously."
msgstr "Te lo tomas muy en serio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18960_Tanimura"
msgid "You'll be like that forever."
msgstr "Serás así para siempre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18972_Tanimura"
msgid "If you're indecisive, why don't you ask me?"
msgstr "Si estás indecisa, ¿por qué no me preguntas a mí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18984_Tanimura"
msgid "I know this is your big chance, but..."
msgstr "Sé que esta es tu gran oportunidad, pero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "18996_Tanimura"
msgid "Okay. I won't say anything else."
msgstr "Bueno, ya no dire nada más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19008_Tanimura"
msgid "Don't mess up at that interview."
msgstr "No arruines esa entrevista."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19020_Tanimura"
msgid "I didn't do anything."
msgstr "Yo no hice nada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19032_Tanimura"
msgid "It's too bad, though."
msgstr "De todas maneras, es una pena."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19044_Tanimura"
msgid "Your appearance hasn't changed, though."
msgstr "Aun así, tu apariencia no cambio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19056_Tanimura"
msgid "Call me any time you feel lonely."
msgstr "Llámame cada vez que te sientas sola."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19068_Tanimura"
msgid "Don't stop until you reach the top."
msgstr "No te detengas hasta llegar a lo más alto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19080_Tanimura"
msgid "Do you really think you'll get famous, though?"
msgstr "¿De verdad crees que te volverás famosa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19092_Tanimura"
msgid "You don't need to go to a mixer."
msgstr "No hace falta que vayas a las fiestas universitarias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19104_Tanimura"
msgid "Why don't you go out with me instead?"
msgstr "¿Por qué mejor no sales conmigo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19116_Tanimura"
msgid "Have a good time."
msgstr "Diviértete."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19128_Tanimura"
msgid "I'm usually the one doing the chasing."
msgstr "Por lo general soy yo quien hace eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19140_Tanimura"
msgid "There are better men than me out there."
msgstr "Hay muchos hombres mejores que yo por ahí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19152_Tanimura"
msgid "I'll run as fast as I can, you know."
msgstr "Voy a correr lo más rápido que pueda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19164_Tanimura"
msgid "Is she cute?"
msgstr "¿Es linda?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19176_Tanimura"
msgid "What if she falls for me?"
msgstr "¿Y si se enamora de mí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19188_Tanimura"
msgid "It's a little early for that, isn't it?"
msgstr "Es un poco pronto para eso, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19200_Tanimura"
msgid "I don't mind."
msgstr "No me molesta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19212_Tanimura"
msgid "Wouldn't it be better to talk in person?"
msgstr "¿No sería mejor conversar en persona?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19224_Tanimura"
msgid "It depends on when it is."
msgstr "Depende cuando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19236_Tanimura"
msgid "Yeah, that's pretty strange."
msgstr "Sí, lo es."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19248_Tanimura"
msgid "Everybody has their preferences."
msgstr "Todo el mundo tiene sus preferencias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19260_Tanimura"
msgid "You should have rice for breakfast."
msgstr "Deberías comer arroz para desayunar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19272_Tanimura"
msgid "Don't overdo it."
msgstr "No te excedas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19284_Tanimura"
msgid "I'll be glad to help."
msgstr "Me encantaría ayudarte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19296_Tanimura"
msgid "Most diets fail right away, you know."
msgstr "La mayoría de la gente falla al primer día de hacer dieta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19308_Tanimura"
msgid "I think you've got it wrong."
msgstr "Creo que te equivocas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19320_Tanimura"
msgid "He's an idol to a lot of men."
msgstr "Él es un referente para muchos hombres."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19332_Tanimura"
msgid "I bet I could beat him in a fight."
msgstr "Apuesto a que podría ganarle en una pelea."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19344_Tanimura"
msgid "It wasn't your fault."
msgstr "No fue tu culpa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19356_Tanimura"
msgid "That experience was just part of your journey."
msgstr "Esa experiencia solo fue parte de tu camino."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19368_Tanimura"
msgid "You're pretty high maintenance, aren't you?"
msgstr "Eres muy exigente, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "19380_Tanimura"
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Nada"

